  "name": "Carrot Cake",
  "subtitle": "Spiced cake with pineapple, nuts, and cream cheese frosting",
  "description": "A moist American carrot cake combining warm spices, grated carrots, pineapple, and nuts, finished with a smooth cream cheese frosting.",
